2. SAMPLE CLASSIFICATION (untracked .oo under std/ + std/src/)
========================================================================

Heuristic (line count + process_exit / string-stub density + type
presence). Spot-checked: agent/memory.oo (types+process_exit = partial),
src/net/tcp.oo (types+process_exit bodies = partial),
src/ooda/crypto/sha256.oo (real bitwise logic, 908L, 0 process_exit),
math/tensor.oo (types + string stub returns = partial).

Classification over ~646 untracked .oo (pre-delete baseline):

  class            count   meaning
  ---------------  ------  -----------------------------------------------
  real-looking       ~264  substantial control flow / algorithms; few or
                           no process_exit stubs (may still be incomplete)
  partial            ~340  types + process_exit / *_stub returns /
                           IMPLEMENTATION_PENDING surface
  placeholder         ~23  empty/comments-only, tiny no-types, or pure
                           exit stubs without type surface
  debris-scratch      ~20  compiler harness / temp tests (NOT library API)
                           — only clear trash deleted; rest residual

