4. RECOMMENDED COMMIT BATCHES (by domain)
========================================================================

Goal: land surface in reviewable chunks. Prefer "types + real logic"
batches before pure process_exit facade batches. Modified files should
ride with their domain batch (esp. src/ooda/sec which has 181 M + 126 ??).

Priority legend:
  P0 = high value / real-looking majority — commit first if CI allows
  P1 = mixed real+partial — commit with stub honesty note
  P2 = mostly process_exit facade — commit only if API freeze desired
  P3 = docs/meta/scratch residual

------------------------------------------------------------------------
